---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "開源與致謝 · Hufu",
  description: "Hufu 原創程式碼採用 MIT 許可。第三方元件保留各自許可，虎碼詞表按官方發布條款隨包提供。",
};
---

<Base locale="zh-hant" slug="open-source" title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <main id="main"><div class="page-content wrap"><div class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="/zh-hant/">Hufu 首頁 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></a><h1>程式碼和依賴，都有出處。</h1><p>Hufu 原創程式碼採用 MIT 許可。第三方元件保留各自許可，虎碼詞表按官方發布條款隨包提供。</p></div><section class="open-intro prose"><h2>Hufu 的程式碼和依賴。</h2><p>Hufu 是基於 librime 的獨立 macOS 前端，不是鼠須管的分支。原創程式碼採用 MIT；librime、OpenCC 等第三方元件與虎碼方案各自保留原許可。</p><div class="source-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">GitHub · syhily/hufu <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">詞庫目錄 · dicts/huma <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div><div class="code-block"><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/syhily/hufu.git</code></pre><button data-copy-code>複製</button></div><p>Hufu 不捆綁任何原生外掛：librime 與其依賴以靜態庫形式內嵌，安裝包不含 GPL 元件；虎碼詞表按官方發布條款隨包提供，對應原始碼與詞表隨 GitHub Release 提供。</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/docs/license-packaging-verification.md">第三方宣告 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases">Releases 與對應原始碼 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT 許可全文 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div></section><div class="license-table"><div><strong>Hufu 原創程式碼</strong><span>MIT</span><p>© 2026 syhily</p></div><div><strong>自有線上詞表</strong><span>官方發布條款</span><p>來自虎碼官方禿版 2026.08.15，按原發布條款使用</p></div><div><strong>隨包第三方內容</strong><span>按元件保留原許可</span><p>librime（BSD-3-Clause）與 OpenCC（Apache-2.0）</p><p>leveldb / marisa-trie / yaml-cpp / Boost 保留各自許可</p></div></div><p class="prose">本站使用系統字型渲染，不載入第三方字型。</p><section class="prose"><h2>Hufu 用到了這些開源專案。</h2><p>這些專案為引擎、詞表、繁簡轉換與配置解析提供了基礎。商標與名稱屬於各自權利人，以下致謝不代表合作或背書。</p><ul class="upstream-list"><li><a href="https://github.com/rime/librime">RIME / librime <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC">OpenCC <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/google/leveldb">leveldb <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/s-yata/marisa-trie">marisa-trie <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-2-Clause / LGPL-2.1</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp">yaml-cpp <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/boostorg/boost">Boost <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSL-1.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jpsim/Yams">Yams <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser">swift-argument-parser <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">虎碼官方禿版 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>官方發布條款</span></li></ul><p>Hufu 由 syhily 開發與維護，介面與文件結構參考了 AIME（艾麼輸入法，作者自己的舊專案）。感謝虎碼作者、RIME 與開源社群。</p></section></div></main>
</Base>
